WEBVTT

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.254
Yes! I'll go way to the back
right now, how about you?

00:08:30.278 --> 00:08:31.471
Yell it out, what year?

00:08:31.495 --> 00:08:32.583
Audience: 1959.

00:08:32.607 --> 00:08:35.371
1959, OK -- and the month?

00:08:35.395 --> 00:08:36.490
Audience: February.

00:08:36.514 --> 00:08:37.921
February what?

00:08:37.945 --> 00:08:39.976
Sixth -- was that a Friday?
Audience: Yes.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.229
Good, how about the person behind her?

00:08:42.253 --> 00:08:43.976
Call out, what year was it?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.666
Audience: 1947.
AB: 1947, and the month?

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:48.110
Audience: May.
AB: May what?

00:08:48.134 --> 00:08:50.205
Seventh -- would that be a Wednesday?

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:52.555
Audience: Yes.
AB: Thank you very much.

00:08:52.579 --> 00:08:57.583
(Applause)

00:08:57.607 --> 00:09:00.781
Anybody here who'd like to know
the day of the week they were born?